  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Many mind-altering substances bring you close to your divine communion.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cultic Opiate<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may choose a number of additional drugs equal to your mythic tier, and you gain the benefits of using this feat when taking any of those drugs. You can take multiple drugs simultaneously, gaining a separate benefit from each. These benefits do not stack, but you can gain multiple different benefits at the same time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc74\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
